---
import { ShieldCheck } from 'lucide-astro';

import Layout from '../layouts/PrimaryLayout.astro';
---

<Layout
	title="Cookie Policy | TweakMart"
	description="Learn how TweakMart uses cookies, browser storage and similar technologies."
>
	<section class="border-b border-slate-200">
		<div class="mx-auto max-w-[1440px] py-7 sm:px-6 md:py-20 xl:px-8">
			<div class="max-w-3xl">
				<h1 class="text-4xl font-black tracking-tight text-slate-950 sm:text-5xl">Cookie Policy</h1>

				<p class="mt-5 max-w-2xl text-base leading-8 text-slate-600">
					This Cookie Policy explains how TweakMart may use cookies, browser storage and similar
					technologies when you interact with our website.
				</p>

				<p class="mt-5 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-500">Effective date: 8 September 2026</p>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="bg-white">
		<div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl py-12 sm:px-6 md:py-16 xl:px-8">
			<div class="space-y-12 text-[15px] leading-8 text-slate-600">
				<section>
					<h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-slate-950">1. What Are Cookies?</h2>

					<p class="mt-4">
						Cookies are small pieces of information that websites can store on your device. Websites
						may also use technologies such as local storage and session storage to remember
						information or support application functionality.
					</p>
				</section>

				<section>
					<h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-slate-950">
						2. How TweakMart Uses These Technologies
					</h2>

					<p class="mt-4">
						TweakMart may use cookies or similar browser technologies where necessary to operate
						website functionality, maintain sessions or preferences, support security, preserve
						shopping functionality and improve the reliability of our services.
					</p>
				</section>

				<!-- Cookie categories -->
				<section>
					<h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-slate-950">3. Categories</h2>

					<div class="mt-6 overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-slate-200">
						<div
							class="grid gap-4 border-b border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 p-5 sm:grid-cols-[0.6fr_1.4fr]"
						>
							<div>
								<div class="flex items-center gap-2">
									<ShieldCheck class="size-4 text-blue-600" />
									<p class="font-bold text-slate-950">Essential</p>
								</div>

								<span
									class="mt-2 inline-flex rounded-full bg-emerald-50 px-2.5 py-1 text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wide text-emerald-700"
								>
									Required
								</span>
							</div>

							<p class="text-sm leading-7">
								Technologies required for core website functionality, security, transactions and
								features you request.
							</p>
						</div>

						<div class="grid gap-4 border-b border-slate-200 p-5 sm:grid-cols-[0.6fr_1.4fr]">
							<div>
								<p class="font-bold text-slate-950">Functional</p>
							</div>

							<p class="text-sm leading-7">
								Technologies that may remember preferences or information used to provide convenient
								functionality.
							</p>
						</div>

						<div class="grid gap-4 p-5 sm:grid-cols-[0.6fr_1.4fr]">
							<div>
								<p class="font-bold text-slate-950">Analytics</p>
							</div>

							<p class="text-sm leading-7">
								Where implemented, analytics technologies may help us understand website usage,
								performance and areas that can be improved.
							</p>
						</div>
					</div>
				</section>

				<section>
					<h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-slate-950">4. Local Storage</h2>

					<p class="mt-4">
						Some TweakMart functionality may use browser local storage rather than traditional
						cookies. For example, shopping or saved-item functionality may store information on your
						device so that it remains available between page visits.
					</p>
				</section>

				<section>
					<h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-slate-950">5. Third-Party Technologies</h2>

					<p class="mt-4">
						Third-party services integrated with TweakMart may use their own cookies or similar
						technologies where necessary to provide their services. Their use of such technologies
						is governed by their respective policies.
					</p>
				</section>

				<section>
					<div class="flex items-center gap-3">
						<h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-slate-950">6. Managing Cookies</h2>
					</div>

					<p class="mt-4">
						Most browsers allow you to view, block or delete cookies and website data through
						browser settings. Restricting essential storage may cause some TweakMart functionality
						to stop working correctly.
					</p>
				</section>

				<section>
					<h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-slate-950">7. Changes to This Policy</h2>

					<p class="mt-4">
						We may update this Cookie Policy as our website, technology or legal requirements
						change. The effective date above identifies the current version.
					</p>
				</section>

				<section>
					<h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-slate-950">8. Contact Us</h2>

					<p class="mt-4">
						Questions about our use of cookies or similar technologies can be submitted through our
						<a href="/technical-support" class="font-bold text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-700">
							contact page
						</a>.
					</p>
				</section>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>
</Layout>
